  {cfg}←pkgID Polish_OS_Props (cfg regPath);tags;groupName;pkgName
⍝ After the introduction of os_lin, os_mac and os_win some packages on the test server were left all being zero.
⍝ 2022-12-25
 pkgName←{⍵↑⍨¯1+⍵⍳'-'}{⍵↓⍨⍵⍳'-'}pkgID
 groupName←{⍵↑⍨¯1+⍵⍳'-'}pkgID

  :If 0=+/cfg.(os_lin os_mac os_win)
     cfg.(os_lin os_mac os_win)←1
 :EndIf
⍝Done